{
    "title": "Cocobi World 1 - Kids Game",
    "description": "\"Play all our fun games in the Cocobi World app!\r\nIt's full of games that children love.\r\n\r\nFun, Play, and Adventure with Coco and Lobi!\r\nPlay different themes: the beach, the fun park and even the hospital.\r\nExperience various jobs: police, animal rescue, and more.\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Feeling sick? \r\nThe Cocobi Hospital offers 17 doctor-play games! \r\nCold, Stomach Ache, Virus, Broken Bone, Ears, Nose, Thorn, Eyes, Skin, Allergies, Health Check-up, Emergency\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Decorate the Hospital\r\n-Hospital Cleaning: Clean the dirty floor \r\n-Window Cleaning: Clean the dirty windows. \r\n-Gardening: Care for the plants \r\n-Medicine Room: Organize the medicine cabinet\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Welcome to Cocobi's fun park with exciting rides!\r\nExperience fun rides\r\nCarousel, Viking Ship, Bumper Car, Water Ride, Ferris Wheel, Haunted House, Ball Toss, Garden Maze\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Special games at Cocobi's fun park \r\n-Parade: Watch the wonderful march of fairy tales themes \r\n-Fireworks: Set off fireworks to decorate the sky \r\n-Food Truck: Cook popcorn, cotton candy, and slushy for hungry Coco and Lobi \r\n-Gift Shop: Look around the shop for fun toys \r\n-Stickers: Decorate the amusement park with stickers! \r\n\r\n\u25a0 Cocobi rescue team! There\u2019s an emergency! \r\nSave animals that live in the grasslands, jungle, desert, and arctic.\r\nComplete all the rescue missions.\r\n\r\nSave all 12 animals! \r\nLion, Elephant, Zebra, Monkey, Crocodile, Hippo, Camel, Meerkat, Fennec Fox, Penguin, Walrus, Polar Bear\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Cocobi rescue team missions! \r\n-Rescue: Use tools to save the animals \r\n-Treat Injury: Help animals get better \r\n-Mini-game: Play the run game with animals \r\n-Sticker Game: Collect awesome stickers\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Welcome to the Cocobi Supermarket! \r\nThe supermarket has over 100 items to buy. \r\nClear the shopping list.\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Shop from over 100 items in the store \r\n-Check the errand list from mom and dad \r\n-Search for the items from six different corners and put them in the cart \r\n-Use the barcode and pay for the items with cash or credit - Earn allowance and buy surprise presents \r\n-Decorate Coco and Lobi's room with the presents \r\n\r\n\u25a0 Play various exciting kid's mini-games at the supermarket! \r\nCart Run Game, Claw Machine Game, Mystery Capsule Game\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Summer holidays are so exciting. \r\nEnjoy the warm sun, sandy beach, and cool waters. \r\nGo on a vacation with the Cocobi family! \r\n\r\n\u25a0 Enjoy exciting activities and water sports at the beach! \r\nTube Racing, Underwater Adventure, Surfing Game, Sand Play, Baby Animal Rescue\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Discover unique summer vacation experiences! \r\n-Cocobi Hotel: Take a bubble bath and order room service.\r\n-Local Market: Have fun at the local market and buy exotic fruits. \r\n-Beach Ball: Play ball and hit the fruits. A monkey might try to block the ball! \r\n-Shopping: Pick out cute outfits for Coco and Lobi. \r\n-Food Truck: There are so many delicious choices. Order and make fresh juice, ice cream, and hotdogs.\r\n\r\n\u25a0 The police station hotline is ringing! \r\nHelp the town with the Cocobi police officers, Coco and Lobi! \r\n\r\n\u25a0 Complete 8 Missions! \r\nToy Thief, Bank Robbers, Lost Child, Speeding, Police Car Wash, Museum Thief, Suspicious Luggage, Find the Thief\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Cocobi Police Officer Job \r\n-Become a special police officer: Traffic Police, Special Force, Forensic Officer \r\n-Drive the police car! \r\n-Collect stars and get a medal!\"",
    "descriptionHTML": "&quot;Play all our fun games in the Cocobi World app!<br>It&#39;s full of games that children love.<br><br>Fun, Play, and Adventure with Coco and Lobi!<br>Play different themes: the beach, the fun park and even the hospital.<br>Experience various jobs: police, animal rescue, and more.<br><br>\u25a0 Feeling sick? <br>The Cocobi Hospital offers 17 doctor-play games! <br>Cold, Stomach Ache, Virus, Broken Bone, Ears, Nose, Thorn, Eyes, Skin, Allergies, Health Check-up, Emergency<br><br>\u25a0 Decorate the Hospital<br>-Hospital Cleaning: Clean the dirty floor <br>-Window Cleaning: Clean the dirty windows. <br>-Gardening: Care for the plants <br>-Medicine Room: Organize the medicine cabinet<br><br>\u25a0 Welcome to Cocobi&#39;s fun park with exciting rides!<br>Experience fun rides<br>Carousel, Viking Ship, Bumper Car, Water Ride, Ferris Wheel, Haunted House, Ball Toss, Garden Maze<br><br>\u25a0 Special games at Cocobi&#39;s fun park <br>-Parade: Watch the wonderful march of fairy tales themes <br>-Fireworks: Set off fireworks to decorate the sky <br>-Food Truck: Cook popcorn, cotton candy, and slushy for hungry Coco and Lobi <br>-Gift Shop: Look around the shop for fun toys <br>-Stickers: Decorate the amusement park with stickers! <br><br>\u25a0 Cocobi rescue team! There\u2019s an emergency! <br>Save animals that live in the grasslands, jungle, desert, and arctic.<br>Complete all the rescue missions.<br><br>Save all 12 animals! <br>Lion, Elephant, Zebra, Monkey, Crocodile, Hippo, Camel, Meerkat, Fennec Fox, Penguin, Walrus, Polar Bear<br><br>\u25a0 Cocobi rescue team missions! <br>-Rescue: Use tools to save the animals <br>-Treat Injury: Help animals get better <br>-Mini-game: Play the run game with animals <br>-Sticker Game: Collect awesome stickers<br><br>\u25a0 Welcome to the Cocobi Supermarket! <br>The supermarket has over 100 items to buy. <br>Clear the shopping list.<br><br>\u25a0 Shop from over 100 items in the store <br>-Check the errand list from mom and dad <br>-Search for the items from six different corners and put them in the cart <br>-Use the barcode and pay for the items with cash or credit - Earn allowance and buy surprise presents <br>-Decorate Coco and Lobi&#39;s room with the presents <br><br>\u25a0 Play various exciting kid&#39;s mini-games at the supermarket! <br>Cart Run Game, Claw Machine Game, Mystery Capsule Game<br><br>\u25a0 Summer holidays are so exciting. <br>Enjoy the warm sun, sandy beach, and cool waters. <br>Go on a vacation with the Cocobi family! <br><br>\u25a0 Enjoy exciting activities and water sports at the beach! <br>Tube Racing, Underwater Adventure, Surfing Game, Sand Play, Baby Animal Rescue<br><br>\u25a0 Discover unique summer vacation experiences! <br>-Cocobi Hotel: Take a bubble bath and order room service.<br>-Local Market: Have fun at the local market and buy exotic fruits. <br>-Beach Ball: Play ball and hit the fruits. A monkey might try to block the ball! <br>-Shopping: Pick out cute outfits for Coco and Lobi. <br>-Food Truck: There are so many delicious choices. Order and make fresh juice, ice cream, and hotdogs.<br><br>\u25a0 The police station hotline is ringing! <br>Help the town with the Cocobi police officers, Coco and Lobi! <br><br>\u25a0 Complete 8 Missions! <br>Toy Thief, Bank Robbers, Lost Child, Speeding, Police Car Wash, Museum Thief, Suspicious Luggage, Find the Thief<br><br>\u25a0 Cocobi Police Officer Job <br>-Become a special police officer: Traffic Police, Special Force, Forensic Officer <br>-Drive the police car! <br>-Collect stars and get a medal!&quot;",
